    ],
    cons: [
      "Dangerously slippery when wet without an additive",
      "Film-forming — it can cloud, peel and needs stripping eventually",
    ],
    bottomLine:
      "Only if the look genuinely matters more than the maintenance, and only with a slip-resistant additive mixed in. On a barefoot deck, tread carefully.",
